"of the total sugars of the similar food, applied to the CREA sugars (or, "
"if CREA doesn't publish them, to the USDA or CoFID ones); saturated fat "
"from CoFID is calculated from the CREA total fat, with the same "
"conversion factor or with the CoFID food's share of saturated fat in its "
"fat. This keeps the values consistent with the CREA ones."

