" acids, the composition is calculated from the recipe ingredients (how "
"much of the sugars is fructose, how much of the fat is saturated) and "
"applied to the sugars and fat of the dish. If the ingredients without the"
" value bring more than 5%% of the sugars or fat, the value stays "
"unavailable."

